<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000">More powerful than any words I could ever put into writing, I wanted to share these videos with you- some recorded by our owners talking about our company's culture and investment philosophies, and also some from our clients, talking about their experience working with us.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000">First,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d5P7wDuBswQ&amp;index=6&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_&amp;t=192s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3Dd5P7wDuBswQ%26index%3D6%26list%3DPLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_%26t%3D192s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFa8evaCYRBDmBcRBK9qwxCgWQD9w" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">start right here and hear the Memphis Invest story&nbsp;</a>told by the Clothier family, owners of Memphis Invest.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000">These next few videos answer some of our most frequently asked questions overall:</font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V8lu1aeirHY&amp;index=7&amp;list=PLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DV8lu1aeirHY%26index%3D7%26list%3DPLR9u_WowgmHqvUdXN1sZmzQOJOuIFBEd_&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEVGiifYzIJaSk7Trme4pg9k9QtiA" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><font color="#000000">How do I get started?</font></a></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SXfMethkcyE&amp;t=48s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DSXfMethkcyE%26t%3D48s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEtuqn_FDhddWYcK5CQgKU8-tzKRw" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><font color="#000000">Why do I need to build a portfolio vs. just buying 1 property?</font></a></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vKHIEJcNB_0&amp;t=34s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DvKHIEJcNB_0%26t%3D34s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGknaqVbrPCoFyhYPMiiknFX2jsSA" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><font color="#000000">Why did you choose Memphis, Dallas, Houston, Little Rock, and Oklahoma City as your markets?</font></a></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XCOjFpDkBk0&amp;t=331s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DXCOjFpDkBk0%26t%3D331s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEPK0_R5LKNPDdCLd_CamrM8Z96aA" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);"><font color="#000000">What should I be looking for when selecting the right turnkey partner?</font></a></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000">Ok, so you've heard from the owners, but you also REALLY need to hear it from investors that have been with us for several years.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000">So start right&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KVIFV5Ob7BQ&amp;t=28s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DKVIFV5Ob7BQ%26t%3D28s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEO_mfoLP51aI4pU6VzDi5EpJin0w" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">here</a>&nbsp;and then keep going&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iDXFJs29D_o&amp;t=85s" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DiDXFJs29D_o%26t%3D85s&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEv6kbqM4tnhtwnXxQ1tzINxfIpfA" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">right here</a>, and if you still need convincing that we are the best in our industry, go ahead and watch&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ol9-pxqJBGc" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3Dol9-pxqJBGc&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNH9QWr4zCQIZaksXi9FgM28Zxao6A" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">this one</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OgcFDsRjJz0" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DOgcFDsRjJz0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFC-nJkQ-ePsPI1VdX0Xola7aU_Pg" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">that one.</a></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000">This next link is the most important of all. This one puts you on the path. If you feel fairly certain that we are the right fit for you as a company and that you would be a great client for us,&nbsp;<a href="https://my.timetrade.com/book/CMYYR" target="_blank" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://my.timetrade.com/book/CMYYR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1549124266381000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGPN8r2OCIeYvGp5myraIznLLOw3w" style="color: rgb(17, 85, 204);">click right here to schedule a call with me and let's get this thing going!</a></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000">Looking forward to talking with you soon.</font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12.8px; font-family: arial;"><font color="#000000">Sincerely,</font></div></div><br clear="all" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div dir="ltr" class="m_2783786535964022775gmail_signature" data-smartmail="gmail_signature"><div dir="ltr"><div dir="ltr"><img src="https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Yw3vz8sampQEMHmb17PfpxdpNSvoBXKwt7W8NZX3sPuDLddPquzaEsjEBOgHbkddyPTwunJGZLXgaInqviAVrUMj3ROq_m5xHnNKQFRQiNosUDevQHZ3pbEf5-efKOPI54zmv7g4o5gdz4e5XoekqcN-_YVFDJjigMNFqii2w6rS0rPSFCn76O-ZTluV61fTAWSJ9V-auSO2ZfZUY9wHF29xdy6qQOMXQ6zLB01pvD4U4kP4=s0-d-e1-ft#https://info.memphisinvest.com/hs-fs/hubfs/Screen%20Shot%202019-03-18%20at%208.53.25%20AM.png?width=1014&amp;name=Screen%20Shot%202019-03-18%20at%208.53.25%20AM.png" width="420" height="172" class="CToWUd"></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
